/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (DEFMAN-2026: IEEE STD 1044-2009 ANOMALY CLASSIFICATION & DORA TELEMETRY DOCUMENT) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
(Project:      DefMan \(Defect Manager\) -- 2026 Edition) Tj T*
(Standards:    IEEE Std 1044-2009 \(Software Anomaly Classification\)) Tj T*
(              DORA / Flow Engineering Metrics \(MTTR, Lead Time, Escape & Regression\)) Tj T*
(Database:     MySQL 8.0+ / MariaDB 10.6+ \(3NF InnoDB + Legacy 2004 Views\)) Tj T*
(Backend:      PHP 8.3+ Strict-Typed PDO REST API) Tj T*
(Frontend:     React 19 + TypeScript + PixiJS v8 \(WebGPU / WebGL2\)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
() Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (SECTION 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & ARCHITECTURAL TRANSFORMATION) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
() Tj T*
(1.1 Rationale: Replacing 1992 IEEE Fault & Waterfall Phase-Cost Multipliers) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(The original DefMan 2004 analytical model was built around the 1992 draft of) Tj T*
(IEEE Std 1044 and 1980s waterfall phase-cost multiplier heuristics:) Tj T*
(  - It assumed a fixed hourly rate \(e.g., 30 EUR/hour\) multiplied by arbitrary) Tj T*
(    phase-lag cost multipliers \(`fixeffort` -> `fixcost` -> `costofdefect`\).) Tj T*
(  - It conflated observed failure symptoms with underlying engineering root) Tj T*
(    causes in a single flat 1992 fault string \(`Logic`, `Computational`,) Tj T*
(    `Data handling`, `Document quality`, `Enhancement`, `Caused by a prev. Fix`\).) Tj T*
(  - It recorded only coarse calendar dates \(`DATE`\) rather than high-resolution) Tj T*
(    timestamps \(`DATETIME`\), making sub-day Triage Lead Time and Mean Time To) Tj T*
(    Recovery \(MTTR\) impossible to compute accurately.) Tj T*
(  - It lacked deployment environment tracking \(`DEV`, `CI`, `STAGING`, `PROD`\),) Tj T*
(    commit/build traceability \(`introducing_ref`, `resolution_ref`\), and explicit) Tj T*
(    regression flags \(`is_regression`\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DefMan 2026 replaces these obsolete waterfall cost multipliers with:) Tj T*
(  1. IEEE Std 1044-2009 Anomaly Classification \(separating observed Failure) Tj T*
(     Symptom Category from Engineering Root Cause Type\).) Tj T*
(  2. DORA & Flow Engineering Telemetry computed directly from real timestamps,) Tj T*
(     environments, regression flags, and actual engineering effort hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(1.2 IEEE Std 1044-2009 Dual-Axis Anomaly Classification) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(  A. Observed Symptom Category \(`symptom_category`\):) Tj T*
(     - Application Crash / Hang) Tj T*
(     - Data Corruption / Loss) Tj T*
(     - Incorrect Calculation / Output) Tj T*
(     - Authentication / Security Failure) Tj T*
(     - UI / Rendering Anomaly) Tj T*
(     - Performance / Latency Degradation) Tj T*
(     - API / Integration Failure) Tj T*
(     - Other Symptom) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  B. Engineering Root Cause Type \(`root_cause_type` / `IeeeFaultType`\):) Tj T*
(     - Code / Logic) Tj T*
(     - Computational) Tj T*
(     - Interface / Integration) Tj T*
(     - Data / Schema) Tj T*
(     - Concurrency / Timing) Tj T*
(     - Configuration / Environment) Tj T*
(     - Security / Access Control) Tj T*
(     - Requirements / Specification) Tj T*
(     - Architecture / Design) Tj T*
(     - Documentation) Tj T*
(     - Regression) Tj T*
(     - Other) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(1.3 DORA & Flow Engineering Metrics \(AnalysisRepository.php\)) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
