(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(All synthetic EUR phase-cost multipliers have been replaced in) Tj T*
(`AnalysisRepository::getDoraTelemetrySummary\(\)` and `getAnalyzerQueue\(\)` with) Tj T*
(real SQL aggregations over `defect_reports` and `defect_analyses`:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  1. Mean Time To Resolution \(MTTR\):) Tj T*
(     - Formula: AVG\(TIMESTAMPDIFF\(SECOND, dr.reported_at, da.resolved_at\) / 3600.0\)) Tj T*
(     - Measures actual elapsed hours from defect report creation \(`reported_at`\)) Tj T*
(       to verified engineering resolution \(`resolved_at`\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  2. Triage Lead Time:) Tj T*
(     - Formula: AVG\(TIMESTAMPDIFF\(SECOND, dr.reported_at, da.triaged_at\) / 3600.0\)) Tj T*
(     - Measures elapsed hours from defect submission \(`reported_at`\) to developer) Tj T*
(       triage and root-cause classification \(`triaged_at`\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  3. Production Escape Rate:) Tj T*
(     - Formula: \(COUNT\(detected_environment = 'PROD'\) / COUNT\(*\)\) * 100) Tj T*
(     - Tracks the percentage of anomalies escaping pre-production quality gates) Tj T*
(       \(`DEV`, `CI`, `STAGING`\) into `PROD`, alongside per-environment counts.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  4. Regression Rate:) Tj T*
(     - Formula: \(COUNT\(is_regression = TRUE\) / COUNT\(*\)\) * 100) Tj T*
(     - Tracks the ratio of anomalies introduced by a prior fix, refactor, or) Tj T*
(       release \(`is_regression = 1`\), linked via `introducing_ref`.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(  5. Actual Effort Hours by IEEE 1044-2009 Root Cause:) Tj T*
(     - Aggregates `SUM\(actual_effort_hours\)`, `AVG\(actual_effort_hours\)`,) Tj T*
(       `AVG\(mttr_hours\)`, `prod_escape_count`, and `regression_count` grouped) Tj T*
(       by `root_cause_type`.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(1.4 Schema & Legacy Mapping Matrix) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(1992 / 2004 Construct            -> 2026 IEEE 1044-2009 & DORA Construct) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(analyse.classification           -> defect_analyses.root_cause_type \(VARCHAR\(100\)\)) Tj T*
(                                    + defect_analyses.symptom_category \(VARCHAR\(100\)\)) Tj T*
(                                    + fault_classifications.code \(FK\)) Tj T*
(raport.Environment \(free text\)   -> defect_reports.environment \(TEXT\)) Tj T*
(                                    + detected_environment ENUM\('DEV','CI','STAGING','PROD'\)) Tj T*
("Caused by a prev. Fix"          -> is_regression BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE) Tj T*
(                                    + root_cause_type = 'Regression') Tj T*
(\(Untracked build/commit origin\)  -> defect_analyses.introducing_ref \(VARCHAR\(128\)\)) Tj T*
(\(Untracked fix commit/PR\)        -> defect_analyses.resolution_ref \(VARCHAR\(128\)\)) Tj T*
(analyse.fixeffort                -> defect_analyses.actual_effort_hours \(DECIMAL\(8,2\)\)) Tj T*
(analyse.fixcost / costofdefect   -> Deprecated \(nullable legacy columns; replaced) Tj T*
(                                    by DORA MTTR & Root Cause Effort Breakdown\)) Tj T*
(analyse.assigned \(DATE\)          -> defect_analyses.triaged_at \(DATETIME\)) Tj T*
(analyse.resocomplete \(DATE\)      -> defect_analyses.resolved_at \(DATETIME\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(1.5 Backward Compatibility Preservation \(`03_legacy_views.sql`\)) Tj T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
(Legacy 2004 SQL queries against `product`, `raport`, and `analyse` continue to) Tj T*
(resolve without error:) Tj T*
(  - `COALESCE\(da.root_cause_type, fc.code\) AS classification`) Tj T*
(  - `COALESCE\(da.assigned_on, DATE\(da.triaged_at\)\) AS assigned`) Tj T*
(  - `COALESCE\(da.fix_completed_on, DATE\(da.resolved_at\)\) AS fixcomplete`) Tj T*
(  - `COALESCE\(da.actual_effort_hours, da.fix_effort\) AS fixeffort`) Tj T*
(  - `COALESCE\(da.resolution_completed_on, DATE\(da.resolved_at\)\) AS resocomplete`) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
() Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf (================================================================================) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
